{"seq":2,"slug":"hdl-programming","title":"HDL 编程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/hdl-programming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"verilog-basics","title":"Verilog 基础语法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/hdl-programming/verilog-basics","wordCount":1500,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"combinational-sequential-description","title":"组合与时序逻辑描述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/hdl-programming/combinational-sequential-description","wordCount":1427,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"modular-parameterized-design","title":"模块化与参数化设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/hdl-programming/modular-parameterized-design","wordCount":1416,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"hdl-编程\">HDL 编程</h1><p>本章系统介绍使用硬件描述语言（HDL）进行 FPGA 开发的基础知识。以 Verilog 为主要语言，从基本语法到组合逻辑与时序逻辑描述，再到模块化与参数化设计，帮助学习者建立用代码描述数字电路的核心能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>Verilog 基础语法</strong> — 模块结构、数据类型、运算符与基本语句</li>\n<li><strong>组合与时序逻辑描述</strong> — always 块、assign 语句与触发器描述范式</li>\n<li><strong>模块化与参数化设计</strong> — 层次化设计、参数传递与代码复用策略</li>\n</ol>\n"}